CHAPTER.VERS:
having provided the yi'ud merosh 

          predestination
         for us to be chosen as adopted bnei brit through Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach Yehoshua to himself, according to the chafetz of his ratzon,

Because of all of this, I, too, having heard of the emunah in Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach Adoneinu Yehoshua which is yours, and having heard of your ahavah 

          agape
         for all the kedoshim,

do not cease giving hodayah 

          thanksgiving
         for you, while speaking of you in my tefillos;
